<title>HONG KONG: SudwestLb executives in Asia to raise profile.</title>
<headline>SudwestLb executives in Asia to raise profile.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senior executives of the German bank Sudwestdeutsche Landesbank will be in Hong Kong this week in a move to raise the bank's profile throughout Asia, it said in a statement issued Thursday.</p>
<p>The visit marks SudwestLB's decision to expand its activities in Asia and is likely to be followed by a major international bond issue, the statement said.</p>
<p>The timing and details of the issue would be confirmed after further discussions with investors, it said.</p>
<p>The bank gave no further details of the visit.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
